OL,3,ARussia frees US citizen Stephen
OL,4,AHubbard, state media reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Vladimir Putin says Russia
OL,7,Fhas agreed to release a 74-year-old
OL,8,FAmerican citizen who was jailed for
OL,9,Fallegedly fighting on behalf of
OL,10,FUkraine, state media is reporting.
OL,12,FStephen Hubbard has been taken to
OL,13,FPulkovo Airport, Putin said, during
OL,14,Ftalks with US envoy Steve Witkoff in St
OL,15,FPetersburg.
OL,17,FHubbard, a former teacher originally
OL,18,Ffrom Michigan, was sentenced to almost
OL,19,Fseven years in a penal colony in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
