OL,3,ARussia frees US citizen Stephen
OL,4,AHubbard, state media reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors had accused him of serving
OL,7,Fin a defence unit in the eastern city
OL,8,Fof Izyum when he was captured by
OL,9,FRussian forces, shortly after Moscow
OL,10,Flaunched its full-scale invasion of
OL,11,FUkraine two years earlier.
